WEBVTT

00:05:55.696 --> 00:06:00.522
I was getting sexual orientation
confused with gender identity.

00:06:01.609 --> 00:06:03.784
And my patient said to me,

00:06:03.808 --> 00:06:05.276
"Look, look, look.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.713
If you just think of the following,
you'll get it right:

00:06:08.737 --> 00:06:11.980
Sexual orientation
is who you go to bed with.

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:15.344
Gender identity is who you go to bed as."

00:06:15.802 --> 00:06:17.803
(Laughter)

00:06:17.827 --> 00:06:20.619
And I subsequently learned
from the many adults --

00:06:20.643 --> 00:06:23.165
I took care of about 200 adults --

00:06:23.189 --> 00:06:24.859
I learned from them

00:06:24.883 --> 00:06:29.518
that if I didn't peek as to who
their partner was in the waiting room,

00:06:29.542 --> 00:06:33.217
I would never be able to guess
better than chance,